      en: ["The Hadera plant became fully operational in 2009.", "It produces approximately 127 million cubic meters of water annually.", "At its opening, it was the world's largest SWRO desalination plant.", "The plant shares the seawater intake system of the Orot Rabin power station.", "It provides roughly 15% of Israel's total drinking water consumption.", "The project was developed under a 25-year Build-Operate-Transfer (BOT) contract."],
